{"suttaId":"an4.60","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-iv","vriCode":"s0402m3.mul","paras":[688,698],"vripara":"60"},"segments":{"an4.60:0.3":"Gihisāmīcisuttaṃ","an4.60:1.1":"Atha kho anāthapiṇḍiko gahapati yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṃ abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ nisīdi. Ekamantaṃ nisinnaṃ kho anāthapiṇḍikaṃ gahapatiṃ bhagavā etadavoca –","an4.60:2.1":"“Catūhi kho, gahapati, dhammehi samannāgato ariyasāvako gihisāmīcipaṭipadaṃ paṭipanno hoti yasopaṭilābhiniṃ saggasaṃvattanikaṃ.","an4.60:2.2":"Katamehi catūhi?","an4.60:2.3":"Idha, gahapati, ariyasāvako bhikkhusaṅghaṃ paccupaṭṭhito hoti cīvarena, bhikkhusaṅghaṃ paccupaṭṭhito hoti piṇḍapātena, bhikkhusaṅghaṃ paccupaṭṭhito hoti senāsanena, bhikkhusaṅghaṃ paccupaṭṭhito hoti gilānappaccayabhesajjaparikkhārena.","an4.60:2.4":"Imehi kho, gahapati, catūhi dhammehi samannāgato ariyasāvako gihisāmīcipaṭipadaṃ paṭipanno hoti yasopaṭilābhiniṃ saggasaṃvattanikan”ti.","an4.60:3.1":"“Gihisāmīcipaṭipadaṃ,","an4.60:3.2":"paṭipajjanti paṇḍitā;","an4.60:3.3":"Sammaggate sīlavante,","an4.60:3.4":"cīvarena upaṭṭhitā.","an4.60:4.1":"Piṇḍapātasayanena,","an4.60:4.2":"gilānappaccayena ca;","an4.60:4.3":"Tesaṃ divā ca ratto ca,","an4.60:4.4":"sadā puññaṃ pavaḍḍhati;","an4.60:4.5":"Saggañca kamatiṭṭhānaṃ [saggañca sappatiṭṭhānaṃ (ka.)],","an4.60:4.6":"kammaṃ katvāna bhaddakan”ti.","an4.60:4.7":"dasamaṃ;","an4.60:4.8":"Puññābhisandavaggo paṭhamo.","an4.60:5.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","an4.60:5.1":"Dve puññābhisandā dve ca,","an4.60:5.2":"saṃvāsā samajīvino;","an4.60:5.3":"Suppavāsā sudatto ca,","an4.60:5.4":"bhojanaṃ gihisāmicīti."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Mp-iv","bookName":"Catukkanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0402a.att","from":1278,"to":1279,"paras":[{"para":1278,"vripara":"60","refs":["an4.60:2"],"lines":["Dasame <b>gihisāmīcipaṭipadan</b>ti gihīnaṃ anucchavikaṃ paṭipattiṃ.","<b>Paccupaṭṭhito hotī</b>ti atiharitvā dātukāmatāya patiupaṭṭhito hoti upagato, bhikkhusaṅghassa cīvaraṃ detīti attho."],"lineRefs":[["an4.60:2"],["an4.60:2"]]},{"para":1279,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.60:2","an4.60:4"],"lines":["<b>Upaṭṭhitā</b>ti upaṭṭhāyako.","<b>Tesaṃ divā ca ratto cā</b>ti ye evaṃ catūhi paccayehi upaṭṭhahanti, tesaṃ divā ca rattiñca pariccāgavasena ca anussaraṇavasena ca sadā puññaṃ pavaḍḍhati.","<b>Saggañca kamatiṭṭhānan</b>ti tādiso ca bhaddakaṃ kammaṃ katvā saggaṭṭhānaṃ upagacchati.","Imesu catūsupi suttesu āgāriyapaṭipadā kathitā.","Sotāpannasakadāgāmīnampi vaṭṭati."],"lineRefs":[["an4.60:2"],["an4.60:4"],["an4.60:4"],["an4.60:4"],["an4.60:4"]]}],"wordLinks":[["an4.60:2.1","gihisāmīcipaṭipadaṃ",0,0],["an4.60:2.4","gihisāmīcipaṭipadaṃ",0,0],["an4.60:2.3","paccupaṭṭhito hotī",0,1],["an4.60:2.3","upaṭṭhitā",1,0],["an4.60:4.3","tesaṃ divā ca ratto cā",1,1],["an4.60:4.5","saggañca kamatiṭṭhānaṃ",1,2]],"before":[{"para":1277,"vripara":null,"title":"Gihisāmīcisuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Gihisāmīcisuttavaṇṇanā"]}],"after":[{"para":1280,"vripara":null,"title":"Gihisāmīcisuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Puññābhisandavaggo paṭhamo."]}]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-iv","bookName":"Catukkanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0402t.tik","from":1454,"to":1458,"paras":[{"para":1454,"vripara":"57-60","refs":["an4.60:1"],"lines":["57-60. Sattame <b>āyubhāgapaṭilābhinī hotī</b>ti āyukoṭṭhāsassa paṭilābhinī hoti.","<b>Tividhalokan</b>ti sattasaṅkhārabhājanasaṅkhātaṃ tividhaṃ lokaṃ.","<b>Viditaṃ katvā</b>ti vibhūtaṃ katvā.","<b>Lokavidūnan</b>ti karaṇatthe sāmivacananti āha <b>“buddhehi pasatthā”</b>ti.","Aṭṭhamanavamadasamāni uttānatthāneva."],"lineRefs":[["an4.60:1"],["an4.60:1"],["an4.60:1"],["an4.60:1"],["an4.60:1"]]},{"para":1455,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.60:1"],"lines":["Suppavāsāsuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an4.60:1"]]},{"para":1456,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.60:1"],"lines":["Puññābhisandavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an4.60:1"]]},{"para":1457,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.60:1"],"lines":["(7)2. Pattakammavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["an4.60:1"]]},{"para":1458,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.60:1"],"lines":["1-4. Pattakammasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an4.60:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
